{
  "sn55.8:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.8 ",
  "sn55.8:0.2": "1. Veḷudvāravagga ",
  "sn55.8:0.3": "Paṭhamagiñjakāvasathasutta ",
  "sn55.8:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn55.8:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā ñātike viharati giñjakāvasathe. ",
  "sn55.8:1.3": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā ānando bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn55.8:2.1": "“Sāḷho nāma, bhante, bhikkhu kālaṅkato; ",
  "sn55.8:2.2": "tassa kā gati ko abhisamparāyo? ",
  "sn55.8:2.3": "Nandā nāma, bhante, bhikkhunī kālaṅkatā; ",
  "sn55.8:2.4": "tassā kā gati ko abhisamparāyo? ",
  "sn55.8:2.5": "Sudatto nāma, bhante, upāsako kālaṅkato; ",
  "sn55.8:2.6": "tassa kā gati ko abhisamparāyo? ",
  "sn55.8:2.7": "Sujātā nāma, bhante, upāsikā kālaṅkatā; ",
  "sn55.8:2.8": "tassā kā gati, ko abhisamparāyo”ti? ",
  "sn55.8:3.1": "“Sāḷho, ānanda, bhikkhu kālaṅkato āsavānaṁ khayā anāsavaṁ cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ diṭṭheva dhamme sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja vihāsi. ",
  "sn55.8:3.2": "Nandā, ānanda, bhikkhunī kālaṅkatā pañcannaṁ orambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ parikkhayā opapātikā tattha parinibbāyinī anāvattidhammā tasmā lokā. ",
  "sn55.8:3.3": "Sudatto, ānanda, upāsako kālaṅkato tiṇṇaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ parikkhayā rāgadosamohānaṁ tanuttā sakadāgāmī; sakideva imaṁ lokaṁ āgantvā d